u>Intelligence</u><br /> Night's Mercy Panacea<br /> Blood-And-Tear Elixir Cultivation<br /> Plague-Swallowing Kiss<br /> Moonlight Cauldron Apothecary<br /> Bone-Mending Technique<br /> Flesh-Sculpting Art<br /> Sharing Luna's Gifts<br /> Many-Phase Insights<br /> Protean Creator Insights (Craft carpentry)<br /> Pattern-Realising Genius<br /> <br /> <u>Wits</u><br /> Scorpion-and-Toad Absolution<br /> Adder Fang Method<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <u>Animal forms:</u><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Snake (Green viper, Totem)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Bear (Sloth bear)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Horse (Brown mare)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Tiger (female)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Carp</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Crow Pheasant (Greater Coucal)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Cat (Domestic, brown)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Eagle (serpent eagle)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Jellyfish</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Sunbird</span><br /> <br /> <u>Equipment:</u><br /> Exceptional medical tools, chain shirt, various drugs and poisons","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-25T07:57:41-07:00","id":1320749,"title":"","content":"Hmm, I think I've hit on a sweet spot combo of grappling and flying and using gravity (Creation's harshest mistress) to do lots of damage. Will take a while to draft together so watch this space but