charms if spellcasting and summoned minions are not enough in combat.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1293395-ex-3-lunars-glorious-argent-beastiary-a-lunar-s-character-thread?p=1390122#post1390122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could see Stamina, Charisma, Wits and Perception being viable.</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you think the builds would be like, roughly speaking?<br /> <br /> I was just looking at some Charms and I realized I should specify whether Totemics are allowed - I guess they should be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T01:46:49-07:00","id":1390225,"title":"","content":"Charisma you do social-engineering, command your followers into battle, and reflexively scare enemies into initiative crash as an ape or other intimidating animal (ape is best because you can use Charisma for Join Battle). Also you have a good Resolve.<br /> <br /> Stamina you're a berzerker-tank and you poison people. And help heal others' poison a bit I think. You probably want to fight in animal form (likely legendary size) because of your lack of dex excellency though.<br /> <br /> Perception you play a tracker/investigater/shaman/archer.<br /> <br /> Wits has a lot of totemic stuff, so you'd need to take the right totem form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 05-20-2020, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T09:57:27-07:00","id":1390312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1293395-ex-3-lunars-glorious-argent-beastiary-a-lunar-s-character-thread?p=1390113#post1390113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Optimisation is completely not required for any builds in this thread.<br /> <br /> Hmm, Dexterity does all right stealth and combat wise. But I don\u2019t think any of the other attributes would be quite so well rounded. Int maybe if you focused on spellcasting. (There\u2019s a demon for everything!)</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's my take on an Int specialist. Not even using the Craft charms, in part because I don't understand that system that well. You're shockingly well-rounded even without spells - I would consider this a playable character, maybe after some tweaks. I don't like the summoning mechanic that much so I would probably swap that out for something else (maybe some craft charms) though.